[{"title":"芳兰怨 其二","author":"凌义渠","text":"数枝缄慎过南金，忍遣尘沾与蠹侵。\n日落小窗频送眼，天寒翠袖好关心。\n初疑幽谷无人问，再虑危芳堕砌深。\n口嚼莲须应独苦，衔杯不语到而今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25626,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滁阳燕亭午憩时与虞素心囧卿谈文","author":"凌义渠","text":"空霭如相逼，层层隐古滁。\n煮茶当昼迥，借榻得风徐。\n素尚周旋外，文情点画馀。\n炎歊殊未歇，恋此待何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25627,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜抵大柳树驿率成十韵","author":"凌义渠","text":"不信人如蚁，循坡历几盘。\n有怀从此永，我马亦云啴。\n足茧容偷转，歌劳许暂安。\n淡浓云皱墨，远近岫含丹。\n聚族蚊雷逐，攒声蛙部欢。\n星光摘未落，月魄照初寒。\n微雨沾肌爽，凉飙荐枕单。\n他乡言采杞，旧俗忍锄兰。\n卑迹耽夷寂，深衷托险难。\n停车一饭足，疏粝腐儒餐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25628,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白?园感梦","author":"凌义渠","text":"桃花漠漠信全乖，中夜波涛急似淮。\n髣髴呼名才两字，伴人幽独到天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25629,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"固镇驿折残榴花","author":"凌义渠","text":"惜将丛艳委尘沙，恣汝舆台插鬓斜。\n点点猩红渗血冷，隔船商女怨琶琶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25630,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宓妃词","author":"凌义渠","text":"红蕖小袜衬波轻，取次仙槎驾水行。\n抵死魅郎忏未得，黑甜影里误卿卿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25631,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"红夹沟桃林诸处","author":"凌义渠","text":"柔飔听入总骚牢，踏踏荒原静不嚣。\n历劫犹馀风气朴，论材独让古人豪。\n饥乌负影窥斜日，怯马奔嘶阻乱涛。\n著眼苍茫看渐熟，浇愁那复借村醪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25632,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冯氏双节诗为陆贞姑赋 其一","author":"凌义渠","text":"擘菂中还苦，丝丝讵易忘。\n灯光扶影怯，机杼入秋忙。\n散发俄垂老，话心晚更长。\n未嫌霜霰逼，留验返魂香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25633,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冯氏双节诗为陆贞姑赋 其二","author":"凌义渠","text":"撚管丹初拭，敲铜血尽枯。\n已甘井底水，那问夜啼乌。\n抱泣惟之子，扶床有小姑。\n才疑风日暖，回味可如荼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25634,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渡滹沱河","author":"凌义渠","text":"硬将脚力当双戨，出没苍烟信马驮。\n时值冬初风渐?，望穷天末雁频过。\n为防石截难移趾，愁见津迷且细哦。\n霍霍水声争上下，也知旧事几销磨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25635,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赵州柏林寺","author":"凌义渠","text":"郁然青数点，遂以柏林称。\n来止初瞻影，迎门仅有僧。\n平悬千尺水，幻接几枝灯。\n但不迷真际，随宜阅废兴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25636,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柏乡公署看月 其一","author":"凌义渠","text":"独夜清如许，何能遂掩扉。\n庭空滋皎皎，叶坠故飞飞。\n当食频停箸，侵寒未授衣。\n灯花挑更结，差以慰将归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25637,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柏乡公署看月 其二","author":"凌义渠","text":"偶然月下立，私自惜幽凉。\n怅望云千里，裁书雁几行。\n霜威入鬓早，烛焰照愁长。\n指我栖迟路，低头愧未遑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25638,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沙河道中","author":"凌义渠","text":"寒气初浓风渐加，日光斜逗冷沉沙。\n皑皑恍忆峰前雪，猎猎真同塞下花。\n欲落群鸦千万点，才添荒戍两三家。\n回看夹道垂残柳，百念攒心未有涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25639,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邯郸吕仙祠 其一","author":"凌义渠","text":"我行邯郸道，意中何恍惚。\n艳事并雄图，经秋同一抺。\n强问道傍人，无言指空碧。\n眼前死复生，头上出还没。\n成功启将来，譬马驰一驿。\n菁华俄告尽，委掷等遗迹。\n余犹虱处裈，故与天机隔。\n小儿梦含桃，频向枕边觅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25640,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邯郸吕仙祠 其二","author":"凌义渠","text":"愚人耽秽浊，达士慕幽玄。\n浓淡各有适，未谢区中缘。\n非无得道者，妄想堕徽缠。\n尊或为世主，次不失宰官。\n试评云水趣，何如将相权。\n仓卒难置对，物情从所便。\n免俗聊为尔，寻仙亦偶然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25641,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三月一日乘雨入天竺 其一","author":"凌义渠","text":"更无馀物佐檀施，真素为心喜独持。\n舆路从他催雨急，鼻香细细到松枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25642,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三月一日乘雨入天竺 其二","author":"凌义渠","text":"泥涂匍匐可愁难，祗取劳躯向此安。\n慧照愚诚各蠢蠢，慈悲不作两般看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25643,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三月一日乘雨入天竺 其三","author":"凌义渠","text":"随缘稽首复何求，默共山情指点幽。\n绕耳号呼忽涕泪，荣期三乐我能酬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25644,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三至湖上","author":"凌义渠","text":"又依湖柳听绵蛮，略数浮踪三往还。\n寂寞终难辞世役，驱驰岂敢避时艰。\n勉留笔楮惭私负，误隔烟云面久顽。\n随众招摇同一到，有何幽绪与相关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25645,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"趵突泉涸久复涌顿还旧观","author":"凌义渠","text":"澄泓听视内，寻脉孰源委。\n甃石护以栏，晴雷殷赑屃。\n晓暾素气浮，急雨光珠碎。\n妄作海眼观，穴深不穿隧。\n清济恒伏流，隐显非一类。\n堪嗟己卯春，泉灵忽中閟。\n岂止地肺渴，得无天帝醉。\n蓄泄若有神，兹理讵茫昧。\n朅来正秋初，再见惊破溃。\n响震空外流，屏恶兼洗秽。\n渐占年用康，弃戈畜牯㹀。\n运会无终极，回环判荣悴。\n对之忘百忧，一笑发浓寐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25646,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"美人蕉","author":"凌义渠","text":"屏却秋声倚冬旭，数枝的烁映深绿。\n粲粲流光及户庭，敛向朱颜笑未足。\n插瓶入镜添多态，秾华萧瑟宛相代。\n那得雪片罩嫣姿，摩诘图中观自在。\n谁言花耐百日红，此红宁与俗艳同。\n唯愿抽心守芳素，莫令长被颜色误。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25647,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过白雪楼","author":"凌义渠","text":"漠漠高怀托一林，问公曾否此栖寻。\n楼仍旧阁谁宾主，代有新诗孰古今。\n早悟荣衰已属幻，果经游止不须深。\n鲍山山石遥堪语，馀雪犹将寒早岑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25648,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"历城贵君招游华不注是日轻阴微雨","author":"凌义渠","text":"孤峰冷插晚秋天，参错阴晴望更妍。\n独涌笋株青戛戛，小舒莲瓣净娟娟。\n游情一往争危石，幽感频生触暗泉。\n醉上小舆归路暝，高低崖壑看平悬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25649,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸳鸯栗 其一","author":"凌义渠","text":"连房迸裂气方凄，具体雄雌翼未齐。\n初发骤疑霜入罅，群游错忆月随溪。\n啾啾一壳啼相向，宛宛双头梦乍低。\n信是行成七十二，总然折队不单栖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25650,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸳鸯栗 其二","author":"凌义渠","text":"不趁游龟叶底莲，覆窠颗颗寄层颠。\n剖开如怯初分项，煨熟宜呼小比肩。\n那忌鸟窥来上下，祗愁虫蛀隔中边。\n长安儿戏乘秋赌，探得双枚亦偶然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25651,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昼静","author":"凌义渠","text":"耀晷正当天，午馀仍未缓。\n避热且闭门，细簟足舒展。\n墙头雀未停，户外蝇方满。\n小僮倚壁睡，迎凉恣偏袒。\n文史任堆前，意慵目力浅。\n聊刷面上尘，层层付清盥。\n嚣寂竟何常，去市止一版。\n偏爱昼能閒，不畏暑方喘。\n徘徊几岁时，日影忽西转。\n微听飒飒声，槐阴来别馆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25652,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙亥春日 其一","author":"凌义渠","text":"黯黯城隅结午阴，风花过眼弗堪寻。\n依方觅睡犹嫌浅，挈伴寻山未觉深。\n不少讹言姑妄听，且随浩劫学安心。\n诗人握粟诚何意，出处无凭匪自今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25653,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙亥春日 其二","author":"凌义渠","text":"也知理乱数难争，人事乖违私未平。\n何地从容承日影，普天毕剥战秋声。\n魂依蒲稗沟边骨，泪湿胭脂马上情。\n直逼寝园堪恸哭，兵戈无乃太纵横。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25654,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙亥春日 其三","author":"凌义渠","text":"垂戒由来叹积薪，徐思致变岂无因。\n官须刻急方称健，人到流亡始疾贫。\n白屋按戈嗔作语，圜扉入夜冷飞燐。\n缓刑薄税寻常药，聚口攒眉容易陈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25655,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙亥春日 其四","author":"凌义渠","text":"迟日端居亦鲜欢，人情蹙蹙太无端。\n农乎失业争投耒，士也忧时愿解冠。\n见说趋朝诚孔亟，忍云藏野已粗安。\n天心伫望时来复，气绕中都龙正蟠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25656,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三月晦日赣榆道中作 其一","author":"凌义渠","text":"路岐南北几追攀，听报前旌始度关。\n渐稳客心知梦坦，暂离官样得身閒。\n乡思早挂天边树，望眼先迎淮上山。\n带有馀寒寒倍剧，莺花未拟放春还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25657,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三月晦日赣榆道中作 其二","author":"凌义渠","text":"情牵物役祗匆匆，略识春光春又终。\n官路有程难并日，荒原无昼不嘶风。\n成丛荠麦疏兼密，夹植桃梨白映红。\n曾记昨年来此际，赤氛千里正途穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25658,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐赋伤心行 其一","author":"凌义渠","text":"经时檐溜苦，一枕自幽单。\n低软闺音凝，淋森鬼语寒。\n靠今无半喜，整旧带馀酸。\n故纸煨千条，倘能持作餐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25659,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐赋伤心行 其二","author":"凌义渠","text":"瞥瞥蟾光过，萧飒任风林。\n为好真何用，况彼浮与沉。\n翻羔惜剩滴，向海酌微涔。\n满拚三万日，一一叩遗音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25660,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐赋伤心行 其三","author":"凌义渠","text":"嚼破咸和淡，苏卿口亦钳。\n阴晴如易卜，嗔喜傍谁占。\n等色自觉丽，等味自觉甜。\n以石置胶中，如何得久粘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25661,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐赋伤心行 其四","author":"凌义渠","text":"士韵非慷慨，女态非软和。\n个中真韵态，侧弁语乡难。\n艾燄无时息，苦澜终自波。\n掀唇吾未敢，愧尔鲫鱼多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25662,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜读甫里集","author":"凌义渠","text":"阁寒偷艳搅人清，妖倩时能扮老成。\n蝶翅不教留好梦，花房无复稳春情。\n频搊蕙带书空影，静格蕉檐逼露声。\n料得邻翁欠伸后，一庭痁鬼月微明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25663,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又赋伤心行 其一","author":"凌义渠","text":"不尽幽明事，被跣向何门。\n花房急短梦，浅土渍新魂。\n赵姊神宜瘦，烟卿语爱温。\n如闻霜月里，楚楚出枫根。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25664,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又赋伤心行 其二","author":"凌义渠","text":"时乎聊复尔，命也奈今何。\n世局限南北，情才总弟哥。\n不那髯似戟，易我面如靴。\n去去从谁道，吾生倘俟河。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25665,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又赋伤心行 其三","author":"凌义渠","text":"春光未觉好，刻日又春残。\n眷爱莺寻梦，功名鱼上竿。\n过淮先颂橘，当户解锄兰。\n三复豆萁语，人情到髓寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25666,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又赋伤心行 其四","author":"凌义渠","text":"不记千声苦，思穿夜漏馀。\n空林叫月鬼，闷雨突群猪。\n险怪敲唇硬，孤清著眼疏。\n飞黄看不了，彳亍自蟾蜍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25667,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又赋伤心行 其五","author":"凌义渠","text":"草昧凭谁立，随波也趁忙。\n骚人工李杜，经士寿王唐。\n句栉头颅秃，肤清气韵僵。\n寒郊并瘦岛，掩泪问时妆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25668,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又赋伤心行 其六","author":"凌义渠","text":"齧齧去来休，何人忍自仇。\n爱深苦无饰，语至谅难柔。\n瞥泪衣痕楚，敲尘镜面羞。\n问伊千万苦，较似死离不。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25669,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又赋伤心行 其七","author":"凌义渠","text":"盼得三岁了，如今又几程。\n晓窗蓬鬓影，独夜剪刀声。\n冻指呵犹涩，枯煤剔复生。\n一编相对冷，难道肯无情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25670,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又赋伤心行 其八","author":"凌义渠","text":"身因多病剧，辛苦看谁怜。\n雨闷孤蛩夜，炉青古壁前。\n泥他先引箸，强我更装绵。\n咽咽难寻省，留穷也觉便。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25671,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又赋伤心行 其九","author":"凌义渠","text":"亦欲斥幽愤，如何又拊膺。\n眼穿墙角日，心脆过年灯。\n露逼愁红懒，鸡寒苦叫仍。\n梦馀还耐忖，树底叶翻棱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25672,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又赋伤心行 其十","author":"凌义渠","text":"病客肠疑拗，佳人命亦同。\n容华皆少女，忍泪自吴宫。\n吊月虫千口，占星鬼一丛。\n吞声未了案，无路嬲天公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25673,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又赋伤心行 其十一","author":"凌义渠","text":"问易应多两，吟诗恰几分。\n无过是左国，何处赘邱坟。\n戛齿真成我，问喉喜自君。\n让他频得手，绝意不论文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25674,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又赋伤心行 其十二","author":"凌义渠","text":"讦激原无用，时才愧老成。\n肠应驱百怪，眼自惜分明。\n蹙缩英雄气，丛残薄俗情。\n看卿真有法，何法遂为卿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25675,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又赋伤心行 其十三","author":"凌义渠","text":"弹指廿年事，离披梦几场。\n师心真少效，斗命亦荒唐。\n吾道悲鱼泔，家门祟雀饧。\n新丰自瘠土，何以巨鳞昂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25676,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又赋伤心行 其十四","author":"凌义渠","text":"俗哆工形似，名存骨亦香。\n只应署姓氏，端可废文章。\n历下琅琊在，盲编腐史长。\n茫茫千万载，但饮又何妨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25677,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又赋伤心行 其十五","author":"凌义渠","text":"那能逐日改，何物似情孤。\n霍玉冤多少，红儿貌有无。\n落花身后影，午梦晚春图。\n君看枝头泪，无心也渐枯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25678,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又赋伤心行 其十六","author":"凌义渠","text":"著眼皆如此，微茫信口吪。\n海风吹落日，怪鸟劫残窠。\n入地搜天遍，呵神骂鬼多。\n卜商诚有语，命也谓之何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25679,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿李母徐太安人七帙","author":"凌义渠","text":"设帨当秋日，孤心早自持。\n萧疏林下气，辛苦鬓间丝。\n出谷求其友，投琼报所知。\n听然逢启齿，以此答鸿慈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25680,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶感 其一","author":"凌义渠","text":"禁尽离灯怯夜阑，败蕉零棘雨中看。\n分明忆得埋心苦，支领春风面面难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25681,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶感 其二","author":"凌义渠","text":"拟将何事艳花关，梳洗随宜趁往还。\n应笑只缘多命薄，一般魂彩落人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25682,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萧园偶题北里志 其一","author":"凌义渠","text":"靡靡游丝去住难，伤心槿梦压重阑。\n凭将陈死红儿面，谱与香钿掩髻看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25683,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萧园偶题北里志 其二","author":"凌义渠","text":"不论兰菊有分身，捻就东皇一面春。\n看到晓霜随例尽，寒香寸寸欲怜人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25684,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋荷效李锦瑟 其一","author":"凌义渠","text":"粉悄香乾烂不收，晚汀风薄暗垂头。\n勾人嫩喘红儿泪，蘸客伤心玉姊愁。\n翠袖自支斜照湿，零钿从泛晓萤留。\n依稀欲梦寒塘月，怕碾香魂半面羞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25685,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋荷效李锦瑟 其二","author":"凌义渠","text":"一枝低颤倚愁看，点点湘纹飒雨残。\n朱箔任欹钗尚缓，露檐偷立唾微寒。\n玉儿到死香为骨，倩女匀妆泪作瘢。\n有底心情酬未了，凉蟾还似趁幽单。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25686,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋荷效李锦瑟 其三","author":"凌义渠","text":"强依初日暂低濛，半剪颓痕拓未工。\n翠碧捎残惊坠叶，蜻蜓贴久稳迎风。\n閒搊江芷留鞋浅，醉倚唇丝亚影红。\n隔岸如闻枫露泻，湿萤差坐语丛丛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25687,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋荷效李锦瑟 其四","author":"凌义渠","text":"姮娥娇拥兔辉眠，殢脸轻沤欲暮天。\n午睡可堪留墨竹，临春亲与试花笺。\n香栖翠琢凭谁主，割水拖脂渐可怜。\n恰忆当年旧锦袜，邮亭相傍数金钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25688,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚步 其一","author":"凌义渠","text":"拖阴花委艳，漏雾月留痕。\n远渡排燐尾，孤萤蹋莽根。\n戛喉诗鬼债，痁影女儿魂。\n一派蕉风涩，轻绵手自扪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25689,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚步 其二","author":"凌义渠","text":"齧齧复喁喁，留题却几封。\n靠人羞鹦鹉，泼毒懒蜈蚣。\n率尔梦中语，依稀病后逢。\n孟郊如不死，塌耳古墙东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25690,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜 其一","author":"凌义渠","text":"一般虫韵搅谁酸，灰死垆欹共懒残。\n饶尽人间惆怅事，小萤冲月掠丛寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25691,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]